  "summary": "Creative and results-driven Full Stack Software Developer with over 5 years of experience in designing, implementing, and maintaining scalable software solutions. Specializing in backend software development, I have honed my skills through academic studies and real-world projects, culminating in a track record of success in building user-friendly and high-performance web applications.\n\nOutside of work, I enjoy staying active with hobbies such as bike riding and gym sessions, while also indulging my passion for video games. These activities help me maintain a balanced lifestyle and nurture my creative thinking, which translates into my work as a developer.\n\nCurrently employed at Clearpol, I have the opportunity to engage in all stages of the software development cycle, from planning and design to testing and deployment. Working collaboratively with cross-functional teams, I am committed to delivering high-quality software products that exceed client expectations.\n\nCore Skills and Technologies:\n\n- Programming Languages: Python, C++, Java, JavaScript\n- Web Development: HTML/CSS, Django, Bootstrap\n- Database Management: SQL, data structures\n- Version Control & Collaboration: Git\n- Operating Systems: Linux\n\nAs a dedicated software developer, I continually seek opportunities to learn and grow in my field, staying up-to-date with the latest technologies and industry trends. I am eager to connect with like-minded professionals and explore new challenges that will enable me to expand my expertise and make a positive impact in the world of software development.",
